  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それ、メッセか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009030020,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うん、エアメールの子だよー！　返信したら\r\nすぐ既読ついたから、そのままやり取りしてるんだー！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300903/2003009030020"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009030030,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "あ、もしかして……\r\n着信音うるさかった？",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300903/2003009030030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、気にならないよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ただ、やり取りのペースが速いと思って\r\nめぐるはフリック入力速いよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009030040,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "あははっ、そうかも！\r\nメッセしてて連投しちゃうとか結構あるよ！",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300903/2003009030040"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009030050,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "プロデューサーはフリック苦手？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300903/2003009030050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "苦手って程じゃないけど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "数人で雑談してると、ちょっと手間取ってるうちに\r\nどんどん流れていくんだよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009030060,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ああー",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
